{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）下午2時05分，警方及消防接獲多個報案，指屯門建發里2號一幢工業大廈外牆棚架起火。消防接報趕抵現場，出動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救。現場亦有一輛救護車到場戒備，暫無受傷報告，起火原因有待調查。</p><p>從網上影片可見，棚網陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空；消防正向火場射水。</p><figure><img alt=\"棚網陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203357527564357632709543.png/Q-EebS9TF60doShV6iJ0SKXNLYzPoEpdZKgsJGSoLCQ\"/><figcaption>棚網陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203357525299302400942576.png/JTxlLGylfIIdfEMFSLx-DhIhBoFrwvuUBKCCkASggpA\"/><figcaption>濃煙席捲半空。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防射水灌救。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203359528213549056675234.jpeg/XkGTXgiekTczpqoH_NNAWtGb3YchfuU-r4Oiba-Dom0\"/><figcaption>消防射水灌救。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203358000954216448385712.png/ItZifZIn_Rp2gS8SE-CZW9IUgDYe6aU8libR35Ym0d8\"/><figcaption>消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203358003361878016603294.png/bUFGDFRFh6Decd-kF2ylt2cV_emhXp9L0ygZGdMoGRk\"/><figcaption>消防趕抵向火場射水。（Threads圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屯門建發里工廈外牆棚架起火，消防出動搜救隊及煙帽隊灌救。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203356683024207872786031.jpeg/ADDmZdQP1lefSHqZsuMLtY0_mErqostX3vSxSd70sUk\"/><figcaption>屯門建發里工廈外牆棚架起火，消防出動搜救隊及煙帽隊灌救。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>天文台於今日（28日）上午6時00分發出紅色火災危險警告，表示火災危險性極高。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:55:06.845323+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:37:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:30.132264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:30.132264+00:00","content_hash":"4497d94527a3193773e7be9be2f270b1be7f235a662ae237c47a49c0ff4d07a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}